#. Content of the 'Message Examples' (HTML) field in DocType 'Payment Gateway
#. Account'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_gateway_account/payment_gateway_account.json:66
msgid ""
"<pre><h5>Message Example</h5>\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt; Thank You for being a part of {{ doc.company }}! We hope you are enjoying the service.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt; Please find enclosed the E Bill statement. The outstanding amount is {{ doc.grand_total }}.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt; We don't want you to be spending time running around in order to pay for your Bill.<br>After all, life is beautiful and the time you have in hand should be spent to enjoy it!<br>So here are our little ways to help you get more time for life! &lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;a href=\"{{ payment_url }}\"&gt; click here to pay &lt;/a&gt;\n"
"\n"
"</pre>\n"
msgstr ""
"<pre><h5>Message Example</h5>\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt; Terima Kasih telah menjadi bagian dari {{ doc.company }}! Kami berharap Anda menikmati layanan kami.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt; Berikut terlampir laporan E Bill. Jumlah yang harus dibayar adalah {{ doc.grand_total }}.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt; Kami tidak ingin Anda menghabiskan waktu hanya untuk membayar tagihan Anda.<br>Bagaimanapun juga, hidup itu indah dan waktu yang Anda miliki seharusnya digunakan untuk menikmatinya!<br>Jadi, inilah cara kecil kami untuk membantu Anda mendapatkan lebih banyak waktu untuk hidup! &lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;a href=\"{{ payment_url }}\"&gt; Klik di sini untuk membayar &lt;/a&gt;\n"
"\n"
"</pre>\n"

#. Content of the 'Message Examples' (HTML) field in DocType 'Payment Request'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/payment_request/payment_request.json:338
msgid ""
"<pre><h5>Message Example</h5>\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt;Dear {{ doc.contact_person }},&lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt;Requesting payment for {{ doc.doctype }}, {{ doc.name }} for {{ doc.grand_total }}.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;a href=\"{{ payment_url }}\"&gt; click here to pay &lt;/a&gt;\n"
"\n"
"</pre>\n"
msgstr ""
"<pre><h5>Contoh Pesan</h5>\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt;Kepada {{ doc.contact_person }},&lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;p&gt;Meminta pembayaran untuk {{ doc.doctype }}, {{ doc.name }} sebesar {{ doc.grand_total }}.&lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;a href=\"{{ payment_url }}\"&gt; klik di sini untuk membayar &lt;/a&gt;\n"
"\n"
"</pre>\n"

